        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Bw1czJ4U6wbQdbXjkW8OD3dr2Bc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-127500-japanese-style-deep-fried-shrimp-DDMFS-step-01-045dceb2990a45c8a45676b694bec7d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127500/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place shrimp in a bowl and season with salt, pepper, and garlic powder.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6OrvUqV5LAmWcmR4rnI4XsOBALE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-127500-japanese-style-deep-fried-shrimp-DDMFS-step-02-acba633856754a13b1f3df24887f709a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127500/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour and paprika together in a shallow bowl. Place eggs in a second bowl and panko in a third bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J0IkdNZUMLpjVNItMBLjMA7l9Yw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-127500-japanese-style-deep-fried-shrimp-DDMFS-step-03-69772e5c1432465c8aa57ab50f3d7cbd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127500/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer or deep skillet to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Dip each shrimp into flour mixture, then into egg, and finally into panko crumbs to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rk6Q9aiY6haY0aQGkqs7PAMAQP8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-127500-japanese-style-deep-fried-shrimp-DDMFS-step-04-342850626ab445b0a2b16cd8dcaf40ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127500/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry a few shrimp at a time in the hot oil until golden brown, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TJ-MPxYVzkNy0lKIXUsRjta4SPc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-127500-japanese-style-deep-fried-shrimp-DDMFS-step-05-3b16ecb3063c4b8ab4dd523fd71e3280.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127500/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
